},{"c":"U 2022 Q3","e":"u","d":"2022-11-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luis Visoso","x":"We expect to significantly overdeliver against our $100 million cost savings plan discussed at the end of the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/09/unity-software-inc-u-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"U 2023 Q1","e":"u","d":"2023-05-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Clark Lampen","x":"And if I could maybe sort of dovetail on the comments around sort of the lower end of the market for a moment, maybe on pricing for Create, you guys just took price when I think the industry might have been at its weakest point.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/10/unity-software-u-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2023 Q1","e":"u","d":"2023-05-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen Ju","x":"And I guess Luis, bringing this back down to earth a little bit and the present, I think you recently announced a reduction in force.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/10/unity-software-u-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2023 Q1","e":"u","d":"2023-05-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John Riccitiello","x":"…and takes, and you can have your own window on what you might think those things balance out to, I think they're pretty positive for Unity's revenue streams, very positive, which is why we're confident enough in a world where this is all happening to raise our guidance and should not lower it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/10/unity-software-u-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2023 Q2","e":"u","d":"2023-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Luis Visoso","x":"Our price increase has been -- is clearly flowing through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/02/unity-software-u-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2023 Q2","e":"u","d":"2023-08-02","l":"cost_cuts