e year, as we kind of came into January, is part of our overall restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/27/unity-software-u-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2023 Q4","e":"u","d":"2024-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Funk","x":"So, just curious if that is maybe the headcount reduction benefit going away in the second half or reinvesting back into the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/27/unity-software-u-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2024 Q1","e":"u","d":"2024-05-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Luis Visoso","x":"So, we're seeing a good migration of customers up, and that comes on top of the price increase we took about 18 months ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/09/unity-software-u-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2024 Q1","e":"u","d":"2024-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luis Visoso","x":"It's just driven by all the changes, all the restructuring we're doing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/09/unity-software-u-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2024 Q1","e":"u","d":"2024-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luis Visoso","x":"I think it was a small increase driven by all the restructuring we're doing over end of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/09/unity-software-u-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2024 Q2","e":"u","d":"2024-08-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Luis Visoso","x":"Growth is driven by a 14% increase in subscription revenue as we continue to benefit from our price increase and our customer upgrade to higher-priced subscriptions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/08/unity-software-u-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2024 Q2","e":"u","d":"2024-08-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matt Cost","x":"There's the P