Yahes","x":"Cash flow benefited from positive working capital contributions, combined with a significant reduction in restructuring charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/unity-u-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2025 Q4","e":"u","d":"2026-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jarrod Yahes","x":"We strongly believe that this is ultimately an opportunity over time for simplification of our business, streamlining of our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/unity-u-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2026 Q1","e":"u","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jarrod Yahes","x":"We're in the enviable position of posting these impressive results while simultaneously investing heavily in AI to drive further growth and create new revenue streams for Unity in the future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/unity-u-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2026 Q1","e":"u","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jarrod Yahes","x":"And we have deliberately redeployed much of that capital into R&D, where our adjusted R&D spend is up 9% year-over-year and AI-focused R&D, where spend is up 17% year-over-year, inclusive of AI-focused hiring and cloud inference training costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/unity-u-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2026 Q1","e":"u","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jarrod Yahes","x":"Performance is driven by the continued impact of our annual price increases, meaningful strength in China as well as strength in our nongames industry business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/unity-u-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2026 Q1","e":"u","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jarrod Yahes","x":"This has allowed us to maintain a robust 70% market share in mobile game creation while passing along moderate price increases and allowing us to invest aggressively in our products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/unity-u-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2026 Q2","e":"u","d":"2026-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Matthew Bromberg","x":"A lot of estimates are showing that direct-to-consumer monetization within mobile gaming is already around 15% of the overall market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/unity-u-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2026 Q2","e":"u","d":"2026-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Matthew Bromberg","x":"We recently published an example of a new partner, a terrific game publisher in Hutch, who is using the Unity IAP product to add direct-to-consumer purchasing for one of their top games, Top Drives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/unity-u-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2026 Q2","e":"u","d":"2026-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jarrod Yahes","x":"Create momentum continues to be driven by ARPU growth, supported by price increases and minimum annual customer commitments as well as strong growth in China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/unity-u-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"U 2026 Q3","e":"u","d":"2026-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jarrod Yahes","x":"This cost reduction was driven primarily by the sale of Supersonic and demonstrates how sharp focus is yielding dramatically faster revenue growth and contributing to materially higher levels of profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/unity-software-u-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[43,1,10674,0,0,0,10490,0],[44,1,10572,0,0,0,10149,0],[45,1,9810,0,0,0,9381,0],[46,1,10145,0,0,0,9957,0],[47,1,9837,0,0,0,9702,0],[48,1,9205,0,0,0,8828,0],[49,1,9581,0,0,0,9318,0],[50,1,9121,0,0,0,8760